  "name": "Bourbon Fruit Cake",
  "subtitle": "A rich fruit-and-pecan cake with bourbon-soaked cherries and raisins",
  "description": "A dense, buttery cake layered with bourbon-soaked fruit, pecans, and a bourbon finish.",
